{
  "name": "robust-restart-registry-lock-leftover",
  "about": "上一个进程在持有运行记录文件锁时被杀，留下 runs/registry.json.lock（内容里的 pid 已死，mtime 是新的，未到 60 秒的过期线）：新进程启动后 run_get 已有记录、提交一轮（等锁 30 秒超时前后的行为）、之后再 run_get。",
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/runs/registry.json": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "records": [
        {
          "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
          "runId": "run-bbx-1",
          "requestMaterial": "{\"channelKey\":\"test\",\"message\":\"first question\",\"sessionKey\":\"s-bbx-1\"}",
          "ownerPid": 99999999,
          "state": "running",
          "revision": 3,
          "lastSeq": 2,
          "acceptedAt": "2026-11-01T00:00:08.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-01T00:00:09.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "events": {}
    },
    "home/.pilotdeck/runs/registry.json.lock": "{\"pid\": 99999999, \"acquiredAt\": \"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z\"}"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Robust run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-2",
      "when": [
        "turn-2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 2."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "run_get",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
        "runId": "run-bbx-1"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-2: hello",
        "runId": "run-bbx-2"
      },
      "timeout": 50000
    },
    {
      "ws": "run_get",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
        "runId": "run-bbx-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "run_get",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-bbx-1",
        "runId": "run-bbx-1"
      }
    }
  ],
  "accepted": [
    {
      "id": "registry-dead-owner-lock-blocks-startup",
      "why": "基线自身 bug：上一个进程崩溃留下 runs/registry.json.lock 时，基线只把 mtime 超过 60 秒且 pid 已死的锁当作陈旧锁（RunRegistry.ts:121-137），60 秒内重启就等锁 30 秒后失败，并把这次初始化失败缓存下来（RunRegistry.ts:60-65），之后 run_get 报「Timed out acquiring run registry lock …」、submit_turn 返回 result_unknown、停机退出码 1。Rust 在锁里记录的 pid 已不存在时立即接管，照常启动和运行；pid 还活着（或还没写进锁文件）时仍按基线等待。",
      "paths": [
        "^\\$\\.steps\\[[0-3]\\]\\.frames",
        "^\\$\\.tree",
        "^\\$\\.provider",
        "^\\$\\.shutdown\\.code$"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
